 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How they combine",
     "texto": [
      "**me lo** (it to me), **te lo** (it to you), **glielo** (it to him or her), **ce lo** (it to us), **ve lo** (it to you, plural).",
      "With «to him» and «to her» the same form is used: **glielo**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In the imperative and past",
     "texto": [
      "With imperatives they join at the end: **dammelo** (give it to me), **dimmelo** (tell it to me).",
      "Before «ha» / «ho» it is sometimes contracted: **gliel'ho detto** (I have told it to him/her)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Combination",
